{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Plantempo 是一款為日常植物愛好者設計的植物照顧日記 App，會根據當地天氣與濕度判斷每盆植物何時需要澆水，並支援離線使用與私人 iCloud 同步。原價 US $3.99，現在限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>天氣澆水提醒</h2>\n<p>Plantempo 會讀取當地氣溫與濕度，自動調整每次澆水時間：熱浪來襲時提前提醒，清涼的一週則讓土壤休息。它只在需要時於上午 9 點發出單一通知，完成後自動排定下一次。你可以按房間整理植物、為新成員設隔離期，並以照片、筆記記錄每盆植物的成長日記。所有資料離線可用，並同步至私人 iCloud 資料庫。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1290x2796bb-204-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1290x2796bb-205-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1290x2796bb-206-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1290x2796bb-207-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1290x2796bb-208-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1290x2796bb-209-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Plantempo: Plant Care Journal</li>\n<li>應用類別：Lifestyle</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-13T09:39:55.417242+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":322,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}